DESCRIPTION:CRANEFIRE (VIE) // MAIRA (VIE)  MAIRA – Post-Black\, Indiepunk (VIE)  https://www.facebook.com/Mairatheband  https://www.cafe-carina.at/2020/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Design-ohne-Titel-4.png They will enchant you with their unique blend of Indierock and Post-Black/Shoegaze. A band capable of switching from dreamy melodies and floating parts to harrowing guitars\, screamed vocals and blasting drums.  CRANEFIRE – Alternative Rock (VIE)  https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61560413372325 Cranefire is a new alternative rock band from Vienna\, founded in 2025\, that blends metal and electronic elements to create their own modern rock sound. The band consists of five members with diverse musical backgrounds. They released their debut single\, „Poison\,“ on May 8\, 2026\, and it is available on all platforms. Timetable: 21:00 MAIRA 22:00 CRANEFIRE
